OL,3,GNEWSAFree school bags for primary
OL,4,Apupils to come in different colours
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree school bags which are to be given
OL,7,Fto all primary one pupils from next
OL,8,Fyear will come in different colours and
OL,9,Fcan be personalised, the Scottish
OL,10,Fgovernment has said.
OL,12,FThe rucksacks, pledged by the SNP
OL,13,Fearlier this year, will be made of
OL,14,Frecycled materials, have multiple
OL,15,Fcompartments and pockets and will
OL,16,Fcontain school essentials such as a
OL,17,Fpencil case, a water bottle and books.
OL,19,FChildren can personalise the bags by
OL,20,Fdrawing their own designs and placing
OL,21,Fthem inside "window" slots on the front
OL,22,Fand back.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
