OL,3,GNEWSAFree school bags for primary
OL,4,Apupils to come in different colours
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish government said the bags
OL,7,Fwould help cut the cost for families as
OL,8,Fchildren started school and ensure
OL,9,Fchildren got the best start in
OL,10,Feducation.
